1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,360
This is the one part of your caravan nobody ever checks.

2
00:00:03,360 --> 00:00:07,680
This is a roof cover for a caravan. Six point five by three meters.

3
00:00:07,680 --> 00:00:10,200
It covers just the roof, not the whole van.

4
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:13,080
No heavy tarp to wrestle on in the wind.

5
00:00:13,080 --> 00:00:15,920
The cloth is heavy-duty 210D fabric.

6
00:00:15,920 --> 00:00:19,320
It handles rain, snow and sun all winter.

7
00:00:19,320 --> 00:00:22,200
Strap it down with the belt and edge drawstring.

8
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:24,640
It stays put, even in a proper gale.

9
00:00:24,640 --> 00:00:26,720
One person can do it alone.

10
00:00:26,720 --> 00:00:28,680
Nobody has to hold the other end.

11
00:00:28,680 --> 00:00:32,400
Folded into the bag it comes with,

12
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:34,200
it takes no room in your storage box.

13
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:37,680
The easy way to protect the priciest surface.
